+ marketplace thismoon -> {HOME}/sources/thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin marketplace add {HOME}/sources/thismoon --scope user
+ install to-install@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin install to-install@thismoon --scope user
~ enable to-enable@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin enable to-enable@thismoon --scope user
~ update to-update@thismoon (0.1.0 -> 0.2.0)
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin update to-update@thismoon --scope user
- disable to-disable@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin disable to-disable@thismoon --scope user
- uninstall to-retire@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin uninstall to-retire@thismoon --scope user
(dry-run, no changes applied)
